harlie **smart**.\n\nNo contradictions arise: While Charlie being cold and smart would imply he must also be red (via rule 11), this is permissible since the context allows multiple attributes (e.g., Gary is both red and white). The question only asks about \"smart,\" which is conclusively true.\n\nThe correct option is: A",
