artness.\n\nAlternatively, maybe being red and nice, but there\'s nothing else.\n\nTherefore, since there\'s no information that gives us a definite yes or no on Bob\'s smartness, the answer must be unknown. So the correct option is C.\n'] 15%|█▍        | 88/600 [2:21:31<12:01:30, 84.55s/it]
