eating the lion, being young) and other attributes (roughness if eaten) do not relate to its \"niceness.\" No contradictions arise from assuming the bald eagle is nice or not, as visiting the lion (which could trigger the conditional in statement 17) is not confirmed. Thus, the status of the bald eagle's niceness remains undetermined.",
