['Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C".\n####\n# Context:\nBob is quiet. Bob is smart. Charlie is kind. Charlie is smart. Charlie is white. Erin is blue. Harry is green. White, green things are smart. Smart, quiet things are white. All quiet, kind things are white. If Erin is kind and Erin is blue then Erin is white. All kind things are quiet. White things are quiet. Green things are kind. All white, smart things are furry.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? Bob is white.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:']
