['Please act as a math teacher and reason step by step to solve the logical reasoning problem. Given a context and a question, explain your reasoning process and give the answer with the format "\\nThe correct option is: A/B/C".\n####\n# Context:\nThe bear is big. The bear likes the cat. The cat eats the bear. The cat likes the squirrel. The mouse does not chase the bear. The squirrel is blue. The squirrel is green. If something likes the cat then the cat eats the mouse. If something chases the squirrel then it eats the cat. If the mouse eats the cat then the cat chases the squirrel. If something eats the mouse then the mouse chases the squirrel. If something chases the squirrel then the squirrel eats the cat.\n\n# Question:\nBased on the above information, is the following statement true, false, or unknown? The squirrel chases the bear.\n# Options:\nA) True\nB) False\nC) Unknown\n\n# Instruction:\n## Reasoning:']
