n is that the bald eagle is not big, so the answer is B) False.\n\nYes, I think that\'s the correct approach. The contradiction implies that the bald eagle cannot be big, so the statement is false.\n'] 76%|███████▋  | 459/600 [12:55:32<4:36:27, 117.64s/it]
