nd \"Quiet people are round\" align with Charlie\u2019s attributes (blue and round), but these do not conflict with the \"round \u2192 green\" rule.  \n\n4. **Conclusion:**  \n   - Since Charlie is round, the rule forces him to be green. Thus, the statement \"Charlie is not green\" is **false**.  \n\n**Answer:** B) False",
