nly way to get green is via being nice and furry, and then green things must be nice. So the logic holds.\n\nTherefore, I think the answer is B) False, because the statement "Harry is not green" is false. Harry is green.\n'] 98%|█████████▊| 585/600 [16:28:48<17:14, 68.99s/it]
